# Local opencode config (machine-local agent policy, plugin file-config).
# The CONTENTS are ignored rather than the directory: git will not descend into an
# excluded directory, so a `!.opencode/tui.json` below it would never match.
.opencode/*
# ...except tui.json, which is not machine-local: it is this repo's own TUI plugin
# registration, it resolves by a relative path, and the suite pins it. A module the
# host cannot find is not degraded, it is never loaded — silently — so this file
# is the difference between a working command palette and an empty one.
!.opencode/tui.json
